{"ref":"BDB, גִּבְעוֹן","hw":"גִּבְעוֹן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבְעוֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:17\" href=\"/Joshua.9.17\">Jos 9:17</a> +; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">ָה</span> loc., <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבְע֫וֹנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12\">2 S 12</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 3:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.3.4\">1 K 3:4</a>;—Levitical city in tribe of Benjamin; formerly inhabited by Hivites <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:17\" href=\"/Joshua.9.17\">Jos 9:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:2\" href=\"/Joshua.10.2\">10:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:4\" href=\"/Joshua.10.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:5\" href=\"/Joshua.10.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:10\" href=\"/Joshua.10.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:12\" href=\"/Joshua.10.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:41\" href=\"/Joshua.10.41\">41</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:19\" href=\"/Joshua.11.19\">11:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:25\" href=\"/Joshua.18.25\">18:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:17\" href=\"/Joshua.21.17\">21:17</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.12\">2 S 2:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.13\">13</a> (<em>pool of Gibeon</em>) v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.30\">3:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.8\">20:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.1\">Je 28:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.12\">41:12</a> (<em>great waters which are in Gibeon</em>) v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.16\">16</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 14:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.14.16\">1 Ch 14:16</a>; vid. especially <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹשְׁבֵי ג׳</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְשֵׁי ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:3\" href=\"/Joshua.9.3\">Jos 9:3</a> (called Hivites <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:7\" href=\"/Joshua.9.7\">9:7</a>) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:1\" href=\"/Joshua.10.1\">10:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:6\" href=\"/Joshua.10.6\">6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:19\" href=\"/Joshua.11.19\">11:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.7\">Ne 3:7</a>, so <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:24\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.24\">Ne 7:25</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי גִבָּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:20\" href=\"/Ezra.2.20\">Ezr 2:20</a>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, גִּבָּר\" href=\"/BDB,_גִּבָּר\", dir=\"rtl\">גִּבָּר</a>); cf. also as n.pr.m. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.29\">1 Ch 8:29</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וּבְגִבְעוֹן יָֽשְׁבוּ אֲבִי גִבְעוֹן</span> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:35\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.35\">9:35</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדְבַּר ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:24\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.24\">2 S 2:24</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵמֶק בְּג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.21\">Is 28:21</a>; it was the site of a great <em>Bamah</em> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 3:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.3.4\">1 K 3:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 3:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.3.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:2\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.2\">9:2</a>, where was ‘the tabernacle of Yahweh in the high place’ according to <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.39\">1 Ch 16:39</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.29\">21:29</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 1:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.1.3\">2 Ch 1:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 1:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.1.13\">13</a>.","next":"BDB, גִּבְעֹנִי","prev":"BDB, מִגְבָּעוֹת"}